#: people/templates/people/notifications/account_deleted/notification.html:1
#, python-format
msgid ""
"<p> Your account <strong>%(username)s</strong> on <a "
"href=\"%(site_domain)s\">Damned Lies</a> has been successfully deleted. </p> "
"<p> All your personal information has been removed from the system. Your "
"translation contributions and activity history remain visible but are no "
"longer associated with your account. </p> <p> If you did not request this "
"deletion, please contact the Damned Lies administration team immediately. </"
"p>"
msgstr ""
"<p> Ditt konto <strong>%(username)s</strong> på <a "
"href=\"%(site_domain)s\">Förbannade lögner</a> har tagits bort. </p> <p> All "
"din personliga information har tagits bort från systemet. Dina "
"översättningsbidrag och aktivitetshistorik förblir synliga, men de kommer "
"inte längre vara associerade med ditt konto. </p> <p> Om du inte begärde "
"denna borttagning, kontakta omedelbart administratörsgruppen för Förbannade "
"lögner. </p>"

